A category full of long genes therefore gets a null that already expects a
high focal fraction, and only an excess beyond that counts as enrichment.

Other differences from the \code{goseq} package: there are no q-values, so
\code{redundant} is \code{NA} on \code{padj} alone (\code{\link[=run_ora]{run_ora()}} also requires \code{qvalue < q_enrich}); and categories with no focal gene are dropped before BH
